# bgc: every gate area 1, delay 1. ZERO/ONE and BUF are present only because ABC requires them (amap refuses a library without BUF); none is expected in results.
GATE ZERO 1 O=CONST0;
GATE ONE 1 O=CONST1;
GATE INV 1 O=!a; PIN * INV 1 999 1 0 1 0
GATE BUF 1 O=a; PIN * NONINV 1 999 1 0 1 0
GATE AND2 1 O=a*b; PIN * NONINV 1 999 1 0 1 0
GATE OR2 1 O=a+b; PIN * NONINV 1 999 1 0 1 0
GATE XOR2 1 O=a*!b+!a*b; PIN * UNKNOWN 1 999 1 0 1 0
